OL,3,GNEWSACouncil awarded #2.5m to
OL,4,Aregenerate high streets
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than #2.5m has been awarded to
OL,7,FHull City Council as part of a
OL,8,Fgovernment scheme to bring vacant and
OL,9,Fderelict buildings back into use.
OL,11,FThe money forms part of wider plans to
OL,12,Frevive struggling high streets at a
OL,13,Ftime when retailers are facing falling
OL,14,Ffootfall and challenging trading
OL,15,Fconditions.
OL,17,FThe council welcomed the funding but
OL,18,Fsaid it was not yet in a position to
OL,19,Fset out any details of how it would be
OL,20,Fused.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
