OL,3,GNEWSACouncil awarded #2.5m to
OL,4,Aregenerate high streets
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Haroldo Herrera-Richmond
OL,7,Fsaid the fund could "help revive our
OL,8,Fhigh streets" provided it was
OL,9,F"allocated properly".
